          "content": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "md": "The loop closes because **the file is the product**. Nothing is exported, nothing is\npublished, and the page a person is looking at is the same file the agent just wrote.\n\nWhat that costs is a redraw from disk rather than a hot swap, and what it buys is that every\nchange is a readable diff in a git history nobody has to touch.\n",
